Settings: add a Logs page that shows what the desktop app and its backend logged.
The main process keeps the backend's output and its own console output in
memory, errors and warnings apart so routine lines can't push them out, and
drops the backend's per-request timing lines, which carry only a duration.
Settings → Logs reads them every two seconds into the log viewer pod logs use,
with its severity filter, find, copy and download. Downloads leave out colour
codes, for pod logs too.

